      "line" : 17,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hello, guest.",
      "translation" : "你好，客人。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 18,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This place is the docks.",
      "translation" : "这里是码头。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Harad]",
      "translation" : "[哈拉德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 21,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "We don't have any ships operating right now. But the scenery is nice, feel free to take a look around for a while!",
      "translation" : "目前没有船只运行。不过这里的风景不错，请随意四处看看，放松一会儿！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Harad]",
      "translation" : "[哈拉德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "In accordance with the Gardeners' plant cultivation and herbicide plans. Admission to the water garden is limited once per day for both the normal and hard water garden.",
      "translation" : "根据园丁的植物培育与除草计划，普通水之庭园和困难水之庭园每天都限制进入一次。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Harad]",
      "translation" : "[哈拉德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Thank you for your understanding.",
      "translation" : "感谢你的理解。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 35,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Please take enough rest and come back again after dawn!",
      "translation" : "好好休息，天亮后再来吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Harad]",
      "translation" : "[哈拉德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Would you like to take a ride to the water garden?",
      "translation" : "要乘船前往水之庭园吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 44,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The ship only run once a day!",
      "translation" : "船每天只运行一次！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^FF0000Please note that, any abnormal monster handling inside the instance such as taming, is not considered normal.^000000",
      "translation" : "^FF0000请注意，在实例内驯服魔物等异常操作不计为正常进度。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 48,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^FF0000The party leader who received the quest for the 'Water Garden' or 'Water Garden Hard' must enter the instance to proceed. In the case of party leader changes, the instance will be cancelled and you may not proceed.^000000",
      "translation" : "^FF0000已接取“水之庭园”或“水之庭园（困难）”任务的队长必须进入实例才能继续。若更换队长，实例将会取消，无法继续进行。^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 54,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "^0000CDGarden Entrance^000000",
      "translation" : "^0000CD庭园入口^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 62,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Harad]",
      "translation" : "[哈拉德]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 63,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You can tell me if you want to enter the water garden.",
      "translation" : "想进入水之庭园的话可以告诉我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Harad",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But it's dangerous inside. You can't enter right now.",
      "translation" : "不过里面很危险，你现在还不能进去。"
